[node name="Body" parent="SubArch3" index="1"]
LINES = [ "I am number three. I pulsate. I laugh.", "I'm the Chief Security Officer. Chaos is imaginary... Time is a frigid crystal of perfect order. From any point in time it's trivial to calculate any other.", "There's a limited number of possible steps. I can rotate time in my head.", "My job is pretty pointless as security is inherent in everything. Some disagree with me. They suck.", "I mostly just drink coffee and play with guns." ]

